    "description": "BAGHDAD: Iraqi Prime Minister Ali Al-Zaidi condemned a “drone attack” that violated the airspace of Erbil in the northern Kurdistan region, his office said Thursday, after several drones were shot down. “We have directed the relevant security agencies … in coordination with the Region’s security forces, to take all necessary measures to prevent the recurrence of such attacks",
